<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31543" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσ-φορά</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσφέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carrying</i> or <i>gathering in,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				7.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> at Athens,
			etc., <i>property-tax</i> levied for purposes of war, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσφορὰς εἰσφέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.2.12
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				30.26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.19
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> in
			Egypt, <i>special tax,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				89.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				124.35
			</span></i> (pl.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			generally, <i>contribution,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					955d
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ εἰ. τῶν τελῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1313b26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>introduction, proposal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					10.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				37.51
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
